# Google Maps Platform API Key (Client-side Vite environment variable)
# Never commit real API keys to source control. Copy this file to .env.local and set your key.
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here

# How to obtain a free zero-billing Maps Demo Key for prototyping:
# 1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Sign in with any Google account (no billing card required for the Demo Key).
# 3. Accept the Maps Demo Project Terms when prompted.
# 4. Generate and copy your demo key, then paste it into .env.local as:
#    VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=<your_demo_key>
#
# Note: The Maps Demo Key has a daily reset limit and is for prototyping only.
# For production deployments, create and restrict a key in Google Cloud Console:
# https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# Ensure these APIs are enabled: Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New), Routes API, Geocoding API.
